@@@!atrep-hom
@=at-rst=>at-html

@@/ Emphasis and strong rename to the at-html element sims;
@@/ admonitions become divisions carrying their kind as a genos;
@@/ definition items extract their term as a strong heading-line;
@@/ field lists are document metadata with no element - dropped;
@@/ footnote bodies dissolve (their deixes go with them).
@@/ Headings, blockquote, and items map by implicit identity.

